<title>FRANCE: Primagaz first-half net attrib rises.</title>
<headline>Primagaz first-half net attrib rises.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable on comparable basis   218  vs	     180</p>
<p>    Parent result				  152     up 13 percent</p>
<p>    Pre-tax, pre-exceptional		   469  vs	     392</p>
<p>    Turnover				     4,656  vs	   4.089</p>
<p>NOTE - The group said comparative figures for the 1995 period were restated. The consolidated results integrate units in Poland, Hungary, The Czech Republic, Slovakia and Austria.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
